            <ArticleTitle>Local anesthesia in transrectal prostate biopsy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1283-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The administration of local anesthesia both topical and injectable before transrectal ultrasound-guided prostate biopsy is safe and efficacious. We describe our technique and review the relevant published data on this topic.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
